// A physical health pickup - dropped by a Breakable via SpawnOnBreak (see BreakLootData), collected
// by walking over it exactly like a CurrencyOrb. Unlike CurrencyOrb it does NOT credit a run-wide
// Frame.Global total - it heals the collecting player's own Health (via HealUtility.ApplyHeal), so
// it's its own component/system rather than a fourth CurrencyOrbType. HealPercent is a FRACTION of
// the collector's own MaxHealth (0.25 = restore 25% of their max), not a flat HP amount - so it's
// equally useful to a squishy and a tank. Stamped at spawn from the BreakDrop.Value that spawned it.
// See HealthOrbSystem.
component HealthOrb
{
    FP HealPercent;
}
